<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="light" lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-surface-bright text-on-surface hf-dashboard">
    <% const propertyUser = typeof currentUser === 'object' && currentUser ? currentUser : {}; %>
    <% const displayName = propertyUser.fullName || 'Renter'; %>
    <%- include('../partials/sidebar-renter') %>

    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 flex min-h-16 items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface px-4 shadow-sm md:pl-[264px] md:pr-8">
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <p class="truncate text-label-sm font-bold text-secondary">Renter workspace</p>
        <p class="truncate text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><%= displayName %></p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2">
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/notification-bell" aria-label="Notifications" title="Notifications"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">notifications</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/messages" aria-label="Messages" title="Messages"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">chat_bubble</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/settings" aria-label="Settings" title="Settings"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">settings</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/profile" aria-label="Renter profile" title="Renter profile"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">person</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="w-full px-4 py-6 md:ml-[240px] md:w-[calc(100%-240px)] md:px-8 md:py-8 hf-dashboard-main">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="mb-8 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
          <div>
            <p class="mb-1 text-label-md font-bold text-secondary">Property information</p>
            <h1 class="text-headline-lg font-bold text-primary">Property detail</h1>
            <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Review listing availability and the records required before property facts or renter actions can be displayed.</p>
          </div>
          <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-primary px-5 font-bold text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-lowest" href="/user/renter/applications"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">arrow_back</span>Applications</a>
        </div>

        <section class="mb-8 border-y border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-6 sm:px-6" aria-labelledby="property-availability-title">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary" aria-hidden="true">home_work</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Service unavailable</p>
                <h2 id="property-availability-title" class="mt-1 text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">No property record is available</h2>
                <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">A property model, listing owner, published terms, media store, availability record, enquiry channel, and application relationship are not connected. This page will not invent listing details.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-4 text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">0 available listings</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 xl:grid-cols-12">
          <div class="space-y-8 xl:col-span-8">
            <section class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-outline bg-surface-container-lowest px-6 py-10 text-center" aria-labelledby="property-empty-title">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">location_home</span>
              <h2 id="property-empty-title" class="mt-4 text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">No property to display</h2>
              <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-2xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">There is no persisted listing linked to this route. Missing data does not establish a property, price, location, availability, suitability, amenity, landlord, or application opportunity.</p>
              <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
                <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary px-6 font-bold text-on-primary hover:opacity-90" href="/user/renter/applications">Review applications</a>
                <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-outline-variant px-6 font-bold text-on-surface hover:border-primary" href="/user/renter/support">Property support</a>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="property-foundations-title">
              <div class="mb-4"><h2 id="property-foundations-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Required listing foundations</h2><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Property details and actions can appear only after these server-owned records exist.</p></div>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">verified_user</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold">Ownership and authority</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">A stable property identity, authorized listing owner, role checks, and publication status.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">fact_check</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold">Property facts</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Validated address handling, type, rooms, accessibility, amenities, and material limitations.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">contract</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold">Tenancy terms</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Currency, rent, deposit, fees, availability, tenancy length, policies, and change history.</p></article>
                <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">perm_media</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold">Media and provenance</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Owned media, descriptive alternatives, dimensions, ordering, moderation, and removal history.</p></article>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="property-lifecycle-title">
              <div class="mb-4"><h2 id="property-lifecycle-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Required listing lifecycle</h2><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Every public fact and transition needs validation, authorization, and durable history.</p></div>
              <ol class="divide-y divide-outline-variant rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-bold text-on-primary">1</span><div><h3 class="font-bold">Create and validate</h3><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Validate ownership, address privacy, required facts, terms, media, and policy compliance.</p></div></li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-bold text-on-primary">2</span><div><h3 class="font-bold">Review and publish</h3><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Record review outcomes, publication actor, visible fields, and the authoritative published version.</p></div></li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-bold text-on-primary">3</span><div><h3 class="font-bold">Enquire or apply</h3><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Reauthorize the listing, renter, consent, availability, and communication channel at action time.</p></div></li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-bold text-on-primary">4</span><div><h3 class="font-bold">Update or withdraw</h3><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Preserve material changes, notify affected applicants, remove stale media, and retain an audit trail.</p></div></li>
              </ol>
            </section>
          </div>

          <aside class="space-y-6 xl:col-span-4" aria-label="Property guidance">
            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6" aria-labelledby="property-actions-title">
              <h2 id="property-actions-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Property actions</h2>
              <dl class="mt-4 divide-y divide-outline-variant text-body-sm">
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Save property</dt><dd class="shrink-0 font-bold">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Send enquiry</dt><dd class="shrink-0 font-bold">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Request viewing</dt><dd class="shrink-0 font-bold">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Start application</dt><dd class="shrink-0 font-bold">Unavailable</dd></div>
                <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Share listing</dt><dd class="shrink-0 font-bold">Unavailable</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-lg border border-error bg-error-container p-6" aria-labelledby="property-safety-title">
              <h2 id="property-safety-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-error-container">Before acting on a listing</h2>
              <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-body-sm text-on-error-container">
                <li>Do not travel, pay, sign, or provide sensitive evidence until the property, owner, terms, and contact route are authoritative.</li>
                <li>Do not send passwords, identity documents, banking details, deposits, access codes, or full application records through an unverified contact.</li>
                <li>Confirm material terms and accessibility needs through a trusted channel before making a decision.</li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="border-l-4 border-primary bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-4" aria-labelledby="property-status-boundary-title">
              <h2 id="property-status-boundary-title" class="font-bold">Listing boundary</h2>
              <p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">No property record means no price, match score, availability, location, amenity, or application state. Missing data must never be converted into a positive listing claim.</p>
            </section>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
